# Examora - Hệ thống thi trắc nghiệm trực tuyến

## Project Overview
- **Name:** Examora
- **Type:** Microservices-based online examination platform
- **Architecture:** Monorepo với RabbitMQ Event-Driven Architecture
- **Stack:** React + TypeScript (Frontend), Node.js + Python (AI Generation), RabbitMQ, PostgreSQL

